{"content":"{\"chapter_contract_id\":\"contract:v2-n-13-4:v2\",\"node_id\":\"v2_n_13_4\",\"schema_version\":\"ordered_chapter_draft_candidate.v1\",\"known_evidence_ids\":[\"evidence:source:3631d05bffe018823a3237bf5f960f6019a971da9e09db207cf248bde7f3d100\",\"evidence:source:084d47d2d65849d0a596638c226ee75d7bb2a089060c56881cdc5c38d4f4f492\",\"evidence:source:e1aa2040476a26a6c03c03e871aec0ec6409454aa4f60033f6f3f4bcfb1fa187\",\"evidence:source:f8dadf4406e4deb335786a8b49f75f855539b1c5f238b3fe7baacb4ad2c3f98a\",\"evidence:source:786fadef65b12af3005b49915e7b7f392636cd42ed1cf034153c563007a86be3\"],\"blocks\":[{\"block_id\":\"block:compensation:title\",\"kind\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"试验参与者的补偿、赔偿与保险\",\"evidence_refs\":[\"evidence:source:3631d05bffe018823a3237bf5f960f6019a971da9e09db207cf248bde7f3d100\"],\"source_locator\":\"word/document.xml/body/264:p\"},{\"block_id\":\"block:compensation:summary\",\"kind\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"试验相关损害由申办方依法承担赔偿责任并提供相应补偿。申办方为本试验购买临床试验责任保险。发生试验相关损害时，研究者应立即处置并记录；申办方应承担治疗费用并依法补偿。\",\"evidence_refs\":[\"evidence:source:3631d05bffe018823a3237bf5f960f6019a971da9e09db207cf248bde7f3d100\"],\"source_locator\":\"word/document.xml/body/264:p\"},{\"block_id\":\"block:compensation:contacts\",\"kind\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"责任联系为申办方医学监察员及药物安全负责人（联系方式见中心启动资料）。补偿与损害处理条款以临床试验协议为准。\",\"evidence_refs\":[\"evidence:source:f8dadf4406e4deb335786a8b49f75f855539b1c5f238b3fe7baacb4ad2c3f98a\",\"evidence:source:084d47d2d65849d0a596638c226ee75d7bb2a089060c56881cdc5c38d4f4f492\",\"evidence:source:3631d05bffe018823a3237bf5f960f6019a971da9e09db207cf248bde7f3d100\"],\"source_locator\":\"word/document.xml/body/239:p\"},{\"block_id\":\"block:compensation:boundary\",\"kind\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"本章不将模板示例或审批结论转写为项目事实；具体补偿金额、保险赔付额度及覆盖范围不在本章虚构，相关具体约定以临床试验协议为准。缺失事实进入待补/建议解决路径，不以不适用替代强制内容。\",\"evidence_refs\":[\"evidence:source:3631d05bffe018823a3237bf5f960f6019a971da9e09db207cf248bde7f3d100\"],\"source_locator\":\"word/document.xml/body/264:p\"},{\"block_id\":\"block